  "notes": "ちっちゃい is a casual/cute contraction of {小|ちい}さい. The gemination (っ) adds emphasis and a childlike or affectionate nuance.\n\nREGISTER:\nThis is casual/colloquial language with a slightly cute nuance. Use {小|ちい}さい in polite or formal contexts.\n\nAs an i-adjective: ちっちゃくない (negative), ちっちゃかった (past), ちっちゃく (adverb form).\n\nFORMS:\nちっこい is another casual variant with similar meaning.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ちっちゃい{頃|ころ}: when (I/you/they) was little\n- ちっちゃい{子|こ}: a little child",
